  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_uv.1": "Light module takes LU. Energy module takes EU and must stay satisfied.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_uv.2": "The controller is the gap in front of the energy module.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_uv.3": "Items enter the top of the controller and leave the back.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_uv.4": "Walls and the IO manager also carry items and fluids.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_uv_plus.1": "Three layers: shell, motors and wafer platform, then UV+ lights.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_uv_plus.2": "The controller is the front gap. The energy module is behind it.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_uv_plus.3": "Items leave the top. Fluids leave the back.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_uv_plus.4": "LU enters the light modules. EU is the energy-module condition.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_duv.1": "The source map also asks for unregistered parts 31110 and 31120.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_duv.2": "Those two cells are absent, so this shape is not the source shape.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_duv.3": "The other cells are sunlight absorbers and one catalytic casing.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_duv.4": "LU enters the controller. Items enter the top and leave the back.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_euv.1": "Same incomplete map as DUV. Parts 31110 and 31120 were never registered.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_euv.2": "Those two cells are absent.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_euv.3": "The controller is tungsten and accepts LU itself.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.mask_aligner_euv.4": "Items enter the top and leave the back.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.cnc_machine.1": "Aluminium walls take EU. Platforms take items and fluids.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.cnc_machine.2": "The motor and the cutter head are casings.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.cnc_machine.3": "The controller is the front gap of the middle row.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.cnc_machine.4": "Items enter the top and leave the bottom.",
