  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.large_gas_turbine.1": "3x3x4 turbine shell. Controller in the center of the front 3x3, facing outward.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.large_gas_turbine.2": "The back center is the energy hatch. The lower back cell outputs fluid. The other shells carry fluid.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.large_gas_turbine.3": "After the gas burns, RU is injected four blocks behind the controller.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.large_steam_turbine.1": "Same 3x3x4 as the gas turbine. The shell matches that gas-turbine tier.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.large_steam_turbine.2": "Steam enters the controller tank. RU leaves the front.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.dynamo.1": "Two 3x3 turbine-shell faces with two 3x3 slices of large copper coils between them.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.dynamo.2": "Controller at the front center. RU enters the front. EU leaves the back.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.separate_excite_dynamo.1": "Five 5x5 layers. Walls are dense steel. Coils are large copper coils.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.separate_excite_dynamo.2": "Controller is the gap in the middle layer. RU enters the front, excite EU the top, and EU leaves the back.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.expanded_motor.1": "Two 2x3 layers of wall. The controller is the corner.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.expanded_motor.2": "Fuel passes through the structure. RU leaves the front.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.fluid_boiler.1": "The middle slice is fixed at one. The source repeats it up to eight times.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.fluid_boiler.2": "Heat pipes, pressure pipes and exchangers are casings. Aluminium D inputs and E outputs.",
  "gt6ktfruaddon.structure.fluid_boiler.3": "The controller is the bottom center of the front layer.",
